{"3620680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "steam_appid": 3620680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catastrophic Inversion </strong>is the multiplayer shooter for large spaces. After a quick mapping of your space, it accurately aligns all players, allowing you to move around together in the same space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE:</strong> The main purpose of the Steam edition is as a dedicated host and spectator camera for those playing on Meta Quest. <i>PCVR is available</i> but it has only been tested on Meta AirLink and might not work on non-Meta headsets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRANSFORM ANY LARGE SPACE INTO A VR BATTLEGROUND!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/59c7a9d0693136769237ed3fabd9c383.poster.avif?t=1774641237\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/59c7a9d0693136769237ed3fabd9c383.webm?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/59c7a9d0693136769237ed3fabd9c383.mp4?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR FRIENDS IN A GROWING COLLECTION OF PVP ARENAS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/a3a9c295b5f2bfce22a17d9b01d82ff7.poster.avif?t=1774641237\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/a3a9c295b5f2bfce22a17d9b01d82ff7.webm?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/a3a9c295b5f2bfce22a17d9b01d82ff7.mp4?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND SURVIVE TOGETHER (OR ALONE) IN ADVENTURE MODE</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/e40a4126897f79d19aa89ce0189782f2.poster.avif?t=1774641237\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/e40a4126897f79d19aa89ce0189782f2.webm?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/e40a4126897f79d19aa89ce0189782f2.mp4?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Notes: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most maps require 24x14m (79x46') to play in shared-space. There are also some 10x10m (33x33') maps. Stationary / room-scale play available for all maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games auto-connect over Wi-Fi on your local network. There are currently no official online servers, but peer-to-peer online games are possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See our website for the latest info.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catastrophic Inversion </strong>is the multiplayer shooter for large spaces. After a quick mapping of your space, it accurately aligns all players, allowing you to move around together in the same space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE:</strong> The main purpose of the Steam edition is as a dedicated host and spectator camera for those playing on Meta Quest. <i>PCVR is available</i> but it has only been tested on Meta AirLink and might not work on non-Meta headsets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRANSFORM ANY LARGE SPACE INTO A VR BATTLEGROUND!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/59c7a9d0693136769237ed3fabd9c383.poster.avif?t=1774641237\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/59c7a9d0693136769237ed3fabd9c383.webm?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/59c7a9d0693136769237ed3fabd9c383.mp4?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR FRIENDS IN A GROWING COLLECTION OF PVP ARENAS</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/a3a9c295b5f2bfce22a17d9b01d82ff7.poster.avif?t=1774641237\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/a3a9c295b5f2bfce22a17d9b01d82ff7.webm?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/a3a9c295b5f2bfce22a17d9b01d82ff7.mp4?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND SURVIVE TOGETHER (OR ALONE) IN ADVENTURE MODE</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/e40a4126897f79d19aa89ce0189782f2.poster.avif?t=1774641237\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/e40a4126897f79d19aa89ce0189782f2.webm?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/extras/e40a4126897f79d19aa89ce0189782f2.mp4?t=1774641237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Notes: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most maps require 24x14m (79x46') to play in shared-space. There are also some 10x10m (33x33') maps. Stationary / room-scale play available for all maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games auto-connect over Wi-Fi on your local network. There are currently no official online servers, but peer-to-peer online games are possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See our website for the latest info.</p>", "short_description": "Catastrophic Inversion is the multiplayer shooter for large spaces. Accurately aligning all players, it allows you to move among each other as you battle it out in a growing collection of PVP arenas. NOTE: This edition is primarily used as a dedicated host and spectator for the Meta Quest edition.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“So much fun, an absolute blast! ... The fact that they pulled this off seems like a miracle.”<br>The Gaming Outsider<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/3488f72cf936d9e3dcab4c8efc5d0d18a64a7a27/header.jpg?t=1774641237", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/04807ad842ddfb878e1395b166ff6d2a2ea04fd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774641237", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620680/04807ad842ddfb878e1395b166ff6d2a2ea04fd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774641237", "website": "https://toastidwaffel.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (or Higher)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Moder